\subsection{Off-Trajectory View Synthesis}
\label{sec:spatial_evaluation}

We evaluate off-trajectory rendering under lateral shifts of $\pm1$, $\pm2$, and $\pm4$ meters, keeping camera orientation, intrinsics, and timestamps fixed~\cite{zhu2025worldsplat,chi2026pointforward}.

